---
import '../../../../public/styles/global.css'
---

<section  class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 bg-[#262424] relative z-10">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white leading-tight uppercase">
       What Makes the <span class="text-lime-400"> Best <br>  Pickleball Ball Collector?</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      
      <div class="text-left">
        <h3 class="text-lime-400 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Training Efficiency</h3>
        <div class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
   Traditional baskets and hoppers interrupt drills every few minutes, requiring players to stop and collect balls manually. This breaks focus and slows down practice. A high-quality pickleball collector eliminates these disruptions, helping maintain a smooth training rhythm and maximizing court time.
          </p>
        
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-left">
        <h3 class="text-lime-400 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Core Features</h3>
        <div class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
          Exceptional ball retrievers stand out through thoughtful design. Look for a collection tray that holds 100+ balls to extend session length. Portability is key for multi-court facilities, and the level of automation determines how much hands-free convenience the system offers during use.
          </p>
         
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-left">
        <h3 class="text-lime-400 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Smart Automation</h3>
        <div class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
            Advanced systems go beyond basic remote control. AI-powered collectors can map court boundaries, avoid obstacles, and adjust to different surfaces without user input. Machines like the Tennibot Rover combine intelligent navigation with high capacity and reliable automation—ideal for serious training environments.
          </p>
        
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>